SUMMARY:Panigiri of Profitis Ilias on the summit of Karvounis (Ampelos)
LOCATION:Pandroso\, Samos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Pandroso cultural association 'Agios Dimitrios' hosts a two-day feast at the chapel on the 1\,150 m summit of Mount Karvounis (Ampelos): vespers on the evening of 19 July followed by a glendi with violin and laouto\, mezedes and drink just below the peak\, camping allowed overnight\, then liturgy and a communal meal on the 20th. Drive to Pandroso and follow the track\; bring warm clothes and a torch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#pandroso-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-on-the-summit-of-karvoun
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#pandroso-panigiri-of-profitis-ilias-on-the-summit-of-karvoun
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
